WEBVTT

00:00:59.499 --> 00:01:01.940
My father was a San Franciscan.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.685
They met and married in Los Angeles,

00:01:04.685 --> 00:01:08.406
and I was born there.

00:01:08.406 --> 00:01:10.659
I was four years old

00:01:10.659 --> 00:01:12.489
when Pearl Harbor was bombed

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:17.231
on December 7, 1941 by Japan,

00:01:17.231 --> 00:01:21.240
and overnight, the world was plunged

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.674
into a world war.

00:01:24.674 --> 00:01:27.627
America suddenly was swept up

00:01:27.627 --> 00:01:31.551
by hysteria.